Dialogue: 10,0:00:02.70,0:00:08.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's time for the All-Japan\NFlying Circus Fall Tournament!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.36,0:00:10.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Here we are at the West Kyushu qualifiers,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.30,0:00:14.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,with Mashiro Udon's poster girl, Arisaka Mashiro,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.15,0:00:18.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,up against Takafuji Academy's\Nhottest rising star, Ichinose Rika!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.70,0:00:21.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Both first-years,\Nhaving won their first-round matches,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.85,0:00:25.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,are now facing off in an A Block\Nsecond-round matchup.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.39,0:00:28.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Who are we going to see claw\Ntheir way into the third round?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.14,0:00:31.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking my leave!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.33,0:00:34.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Point to Ichinose!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.51,0:00:35.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The first point is mine!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.23,0:00:49.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If such an inconsequential\Nmatch excites them so,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.60,0:00:55.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,perhaps we should let our FC silence them.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:55.66,0:00:58.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If we win two tournaments in a row,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.95,0:01:01.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,the FC community will be forced to admit...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.02,0:01:04.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That what we created is superior.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:05.02,0:01:08.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That our beautiful, perfect FC is superior.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.12,0:02:44.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,In the second round of A Block,\Na speeder mirror matchup,
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.43,0:02:47.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ichinose has drawn first blood!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.66,0:02:50.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's going to pull away!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.90,0:02:53.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Remember, M-Mashiro-chan!\NIt's all about spirit!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.72,0:02:55.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Why are {\i1}you{\i0} so nervous?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.86,0:02:57.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Step on it, Mashiro!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.10,0:03:00.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Put your gameplan into motion!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.16,0:03:00.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.79,0:03:01.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:05.00,0:03:05.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mashiro.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.80,0:03:09.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's both do our best in our match today.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.72,0:03:12.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Of course! I'll be coming\Nfor you with everything I have!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.55,0:03:15.92,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Rika.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.67,0:03:21.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's all thanks to you that I managed\Nto find my own style of FC...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.02,0:03:22.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That I managed to get this far.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.15,0:03:25.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't do anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.28,0:03:27.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're the one who put in\Nthe effort to make it this far.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:27.31,0:03:30.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Compared to how much effort\Nyou put in, I've still got a ways to go.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.07,0:03:33.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But I refuse to lose!{ep10 preview line}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:33.55,0:03:35.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll beat you this time for sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.06,0:03:36.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.19,0:03:38.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Bring it on.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.03,0:03:44.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mashiro-chan's making her move.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.94,0:03:45.87,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.60,0:03:49.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Point to Ichinose! 0-2!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.83,0:03:52.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ichinose's grabbed a solid two-point lead!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.90,0:03:54.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Can Arisaka come back from this?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.79,0:03:57.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Where's Mashiro? I thought she took a shortcut.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.37,0:03:58.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Above you!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.05,0:04:00.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mashiro?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.80,0:04:03.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I call this the Pickle Stone Maneuver!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.68,0:04:05.09,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And I'm putting it into play!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.09,0:04:06.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,"Pickle Stone"? Come on.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.98,0:04:09.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She'll apply pressure on her opponent\Nby positioning herself above,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.30,0:04:11.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,and then go for either\Nher back or the next buoy.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.59,0:04:13.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is just like Inui-san's tactic!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.19,0:04:17.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Smart move, I must admit.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.11,0:04:19.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Goddammit! I wanted to face her!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.57,0:04:21.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mind your language, young lady.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.67,0:04:23.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I-I'm so sorry, milady!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.66,0:04:27.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She got a good read on Ichinose's\Nmovements and got above her.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.16,0:04:30.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Here I come!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.42,0:04:39.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Got you!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.40,0:04:42.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Point to Arisaka! 1-2!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.40,0:04:45.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Point to Arisaka!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.76,0:04:47.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We're matched point for point!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.06,0:04:51.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Arisaka scored two straight\Npoints to level the score!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.33,0:04:54.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's the way, Arisaka!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.59,0:04:58.15,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,{\an8}As a fellow speeder,\NI'll share some of my spirit with you!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.59,0:04:58.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Only team members are allowed back here, Bro.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.15,0:05:01.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Take a shortcut to the fourth\Nline at once, Ichinose-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.39,0:05:02.03,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.58,0:05:04.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not letting you past!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.57,0:05:06.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You must stop her, no matter what.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.15,0:05:07.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let her slip past.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.37,0:05:08.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.62,0:05:13.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A back punch?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.61,0:05:15.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nicely done.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.10,0:05:19.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're mine!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.00,0:05:23.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Point to Ichinose! 2-3!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.14,0:05:33.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ultimate Move: Mashiro Punch!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.56,0:05:38.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Point to Arisaka! 3-3!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.02,0:05:39.51,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Mashiro!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.51,0:05:40.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This match is too close!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.57,0:05:44.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I haven't been taking on Misaki-senpai\Nor Asuka-senpai for show, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.66,0:05:45.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll beat you this time for sure!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:45.99,0:05:47.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I want to win, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.42,0:05:52.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ichinose-chan has gotten a lot better\Nat dogfighting since summer.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.74,0:05:55.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She must've practiced really\Nhard after losing to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.53,0:05:57.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They're both awesome!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.30,0:06:00.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Guess I should've learned a thing\Nor two from my defeat, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.33,0:06:01.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What did I {\i1}just{\i0} say, Bro?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.05,0:06:05.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We'll have to put some effort\Nin to not get overshadowed.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.19,0:06:06.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.27,0:06:12.16,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Clock's ticking down!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.16,0:06:14.11,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Who will triumph in this one?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.11,0:06:20.35,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Takafuji's Ichinose, or Kunahama's Arisaka?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.48,0:06:16.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That match is still going?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.27,0:06:18.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kunahama...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.56,0:06:26.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But I'm practicing really hard right now so I can\Nhave an exciting match with you next time.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.17,0:06:27.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So look forward to the fall tournament—
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.81,0:06:28.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's out of the question.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.30,0:06:33.37,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Saki?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.37,0:06:34.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.87,0:06:40.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Make a beeline for the first buoy, Mashiro!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.70,0:06:41.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:42.00,0:06:42.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh no you don't!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.96,0:06:48.18,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mashirocchi...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.00,0:06:58.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Point to Arisaka!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.10,0:06:59.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,4-3!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.57,0:07:03.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This match is over! Arisaka wins!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.36,0:07:04.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.32,0:07:05.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.73,0:07:08.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Atta girl, Mashiro!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.29,0:07:13.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Arisaka wins a hard-fought battle\Nto advance to the third round!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.74,0:07:17.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You were great, Mashiro!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:17.24,0:07:18.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Rika...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.64,0:07:21.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I—
Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.50,0:07:23.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Congrats, Mashiro.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.06,0:07:26.75,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But I'll be the one to win next time.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.45,0:07:32.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,In your dreams, Rika.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.56,0:07:34.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll have the last laugh next time, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.19,0:07:40.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Mashiro-chan played so well.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.29,0:07:43.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,All right! Time to break a leg myself!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.27,0:07:44.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna win, no matter what!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.94,0:07:45.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.94,0:07:49.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Here's yer order!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.54,0:07:51.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,It's hot. Be careful not to burn yer tongue.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.99,0:07:54.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's eat!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.19,0:08:00.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So, how's that victory udon taste?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.79,0:08:01.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.79,0:08:04.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Aw, you bring a tear to Mommy's eye.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.23,0:08:05.73,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I wasn't talking to you, Mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.12,0:08:08.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Congrats, Mashiro.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.67,0:08:11.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll allow you to treat me to udon to celebrate.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.20,0:08:12.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Stop that, Arika.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.13,0:08:13.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.28,0:08:14.50,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fine by me!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.50,0:08:18.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Everyone who rooted for Mashiro\Ngets to eat on the house!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.28,0:08:20.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're embarrassing me, Mom.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.43,0:08:23.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,We've come to sample the offerings as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.17,0:08:26.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,When I told them Mashiro Udon serves\Ngreat food, they wanted to try some.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.69,0:08:28.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Shindou-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.11,0:08:29.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I didn't know you were here to watch.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.65,0:08:30.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.80,0:08:32.78,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm here to cheer on\Nmy little members of course,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.78,0:08:35.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,but I'd be lying if I said I wasn't\Nalso curious to see Inui's play.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.78,0:08:37.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How are things, Hinata-kun?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.52,0:08:39.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I think we're as ready as we'll ever be.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.79,0:08:43.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking her on in the third round.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.14,0:08:46.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I shall partake in some udon and\Nensure I play with maximum spirit!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.79,0:08:50.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll have yer bowls ready right away.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.56,0:08:53.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,A-Asuka-chan! You need to get\Nready for the next match!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.69,0:08:55.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,R-Right! I'd better hurry!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.44,0:08:56.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll eat some more and join you later.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.80,0:08:58.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What a lively bunch.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.87,0:09:03.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Stay on your toes, Aoi.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.04,0:09:05.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Where did that come from?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.01,0:09:09.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kairyou Academy's Inui Saki\Nand her second, Irina Avalon...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.36,0:09:11.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Those two are no ordinary team.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:12.36,0:09:13.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.76,0:09:16.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's been old news since\Nthe summer tournament.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.54,0:09:18.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No, that's not all I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.85,0:09:20.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I bet they still have\Nsomething up their sleeves.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.45,0:09:22.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That Avalon brand bothers me.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.54,0:09:26.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Is this your instinct as an\Nexperienced dealer talking?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.10,0:09:30.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There's something off\Nabout those Grav-Shoes.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.93,0:09:33.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll keep my eyes peeled.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.65,0:09:38.76,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kurashina is the victor!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.48,0:09:40.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well played.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.36,0:09:41.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.39,0:09:44.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That flying fish-like\Nbarrel roll was really pretty!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.01,0:09:47.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Where's Misaki-chan?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.23,0:09:50.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Over at B Block. Her next match begins soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.68,0:09:53.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She was having an udon-eating\Ncontest until just now, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.29,0:09:55.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I hope she doesn't get an upset tummy.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.11,0:09:57.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But Shindou-san was something else.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.79,0:09:58.66,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.66,0:10:01.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,He slurped up those noodles up like a cobra.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.43,0:10:03.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The match is over!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.08,0:10:06.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Inui is the victor, 8-0!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.96,0:10:10.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's good! Way too good!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.00,0:10:13.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Again with the Birdcage,\Nthe technique which dethroned Shindou,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.88,0:10:16.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Inui inflicts a crushing defeat on Satouin!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.15,0:10:18.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Impeccable play, Saki. Keep it up.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.94,0:10:19.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.91,0:10:25.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The first day of the\Nfall tournament comes to a close,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.82,0:10:28.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,and all matches up to the third\Nround have been completed!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.03,0:10:32.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,In the A Block semifinals, Ganeko,\None of the favorites for the title,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.54,0:10:37.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,will face Kurashina, who pushed\NShindou all the way in summer!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.57,0:10:41.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And in the other semifinal in B Block, Inui,\Nafter her overwhelming victory over Satouin,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.32,0:10:47.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,takes on another rising star\Nfrom Kunahama, Tobisawa!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.00,0:10:54.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry I was the only one\Nto lose in the third round.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.04,0:10:56.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. You did great.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.65,0:10:58.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's right, Mashiro-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.44,0:11:01.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You put up a good fight against Ganeko-san,\Nwho placed third in summer.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.47,0:11:04.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Misaki, you're going up against Inui tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.43,0:11:08.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna show off the fruits of\Nall the training I've done and win!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.06,0:11:11.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And then, I'll play Asuka in the final.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.92,0:11:12.69,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.69,0:11:14.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:17.69,0:11:19.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.17,0:11:21.20,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,They're leaving in that?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.67,0:11:24.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.35,0:11:26.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's—
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.08,0:11:30.57,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.57,0:11:31.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Inui-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.86,0:11:33.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.42,0:11:36.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Saki hasn't had to work at all.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.26,0:11:38.34,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But I'm sure you're all exhausted,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.34,0:11:40.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,so please do get some rest.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.72,0:11:46.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If not, Saki won't be able to show\Nthe world a perfect victory.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.06,0:11:47.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're assuming you're gonna win?!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.31,0:11:48.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Be seeing you, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.48,0:11:51.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let us do our best tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.95,0:12:24.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:24.79,0:12:28.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going to root for you with\Nall my heart, Misaki-senpai!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.31,0:12:30.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This isn't some idol concert, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.04,0:12:31.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,In Mashiro-chan's eyes,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.45,0:12:34.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,this might just be a\NFlying Misaki-senpai Show.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.97,0:12:38.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Allow me, Arisaka Mashiro,\Nto sing the official cheering song!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.36,0:12:45.28,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Fly across the starry sky with your unrivaled wings.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:40.56,0:12:43.21,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this is really firing me up!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.21,0:12:47.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I can't focus like this, so when you\Nroot for me, do it where I won't see you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.28,0:12:47.74,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Your answer is surely—
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.74,0:12:48.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What? You meanie!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.81,0:12:50.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize I'm doing\Nthis out of love for you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.94,0:12:52.02,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.02,0:12:54.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How full of energy we are,\Nfirst thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.16,0:12:56.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.48,0:12:58.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Inui-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.63,0:13:01.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Make as much noise as you want, while you still can.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.29,0:13:05.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,For you'll undoubtedly be silent\Nonce the match begins.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.02,0:13:08.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so sure of that.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.06,0:13:11.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You never know how a match will go.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.00,0:13:14.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I can't wait to find out.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.10,0:13:15.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,See you.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.65,0:13:23.82,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Here we are at the second day\Nof the fall tournament!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:24.19,0:13:27.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kurashina is currently on top against Ganeko!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.33,0:13:30.49,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Milady!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.33,0:13:39.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Point to Kurashina! 2-5!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.96,0:13:42.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Go, Asuka-senpai!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.88,0:13:46.01,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're too careless!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.32,0:13:53.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I see you're quite fired up, Tobisawa-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.92,0:13:56.56,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Shindou-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:57.19,0:13:59.89,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I look forward to great things\Nfrom your zipzapping.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.07,0:14:02.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.39,0:14:12.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But really, I wanted to beat you\Nat that udon-eating contest.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.90,0:14:16.33,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll take you on anytime.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.33,0:14:20.13,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If I beat Inui-san, I'm coming for you next.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.12,0:14:30.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Point to Kurashina!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.31,0:14:35.97,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The match is over!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.97,0:14:37.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kurashina is the victor!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.94,0:14:39.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,In the A Block semifinal,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.85,0:14:43.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Kurashina eliminates Ganeko,\Nwho placed third last time around,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.65,0:14:45.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,to progress to her first-ever final!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.66,0:14:49.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Next up, we have the B Block semifinal!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.24,0:14:51.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Who will face Kurashina in the final?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.90,0:14:54.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Will it be the Dominating\NQueen of the Sky, Inui Saki,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.58,0:14:57.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,or will it be the Wildcat Fighter,\NTobisawa Misaki?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.58,0:14:59.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Break a leg, Misaki-senpai!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.88,0:15:01.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,If you win, we'll let you have\Nfree udon for a year!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.93,0:15:04.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Settle down, Mashirocchi.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.45,0:15:07.05,GJM_Overlap,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hooray, hooray, Misaki-senpai!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.82,0:15:07.05,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Would you listen to me?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.59,0:15:08.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Misaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.07,0:15:10.93,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Scared?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:12.94,0:15:14.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.64,0:15:19.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I mean, Inui-san steamrolled Satouin-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.04,0:15:21.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And I could lose the same way.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:21.94,0:15:25.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'll admit that I am\Npretty scared of that prospect.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.37,0:15:27.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Misaki...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.17,0:15:33.99,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But it's {\i1}because{\i0} I lost that I could\Ntake a long, hard look at myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.99,0:15:37.45,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And it's {\i1}because{\i0} I lost\Nthat I could dedicate myself to FC.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:38.66,0:15:41.58,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm gonna go on\Nthe offensive and never stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.92,0:15:44.63,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That is {\i1}my{\i0} brand of FC!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.41,0:15:47.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.49,0:15:55.64,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Inui-san...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:57.28,0:16:00.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna break free of your Birdcage.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.27,0:16:02.14,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You'd best be prepared to zipzap.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.51,0:16:04.10,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Get ready...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.24,0:16:14.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Set!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.45,0:16:20.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And we're off!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.31,0:16:21.54,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Inui's heading for the buoy,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.54,0:16:24.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,whereas Tobisawa immediately took a shortcut!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.25,0:16:28.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Point to Inui!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.80,0:16:39.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So it does come down to this after all.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.31,0:16:40.38,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Now, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.38,0:16:43.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What will you do, Tobisawa-kun?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.03,0:16:44.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Misaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.94,0:16:49.28,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Inui's looking to win all her matches\Nin this tournament with the Birdcage.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.84,0:16:52.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,So you should be able to\Nclose on her from below.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.60,0:16:53.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.62,0:16:56.53,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,As always, I'm gonna look to get\Ndown and dirty in a dogfight.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.53,0:16:57.59,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's the way.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.59,0:17:00.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Once you get close, stick to her like glue
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.70,0:17:02.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,and break her down bit by bit!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.30,0:17:03.68,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The entire time?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.68,0:17:05.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This is gonna be a pain in the tail.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.79,0:17:08.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But quitting would be even worse!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.72,0:17:11.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.30,0:17:12.88,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.31,0:17:20.27,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Tobisawa with an insane burst of speed!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.23,0:17:29.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Come on, Inui-san. Let's zipzap.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.68,0:17:32.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let her get away, Misaki!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.44,0:17:33.65,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No need to tell me!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.86,0:17:36.80,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sonic Boost, hm?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.80,0:17:39.43,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She must've practiced a whole lot.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.94,0:17:40.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.42,0:17:43.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,No change in plans, Saki.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.67,0:17:45.47,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Push her down to the water.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:45.47,0:17:47.25,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, Irina.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.09,0:17:52.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Inui suddenly stopped in her tracks\Nand blew Tobisawa back,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.67,0:17:54.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,and now Tobisawa's falling!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.43,0:17:58.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I said, let's zip...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.30,0:17:59.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,zap!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.31,0:18:03.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not done!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.31,0:18:09.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,And again!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.63,0:18:21.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,How's that? Did it fire you up some?{ep10 preview line}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.06,0:18:25.24,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Saki...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:25.24,0:18:26.90,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let her dictate the tempo.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.90,0:18:27.83,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.83,0:18:30.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,This match is so like Misaki-senpai!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.40,0:18:31.04,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.71,0:18:36.30,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, Tobisawa has been forced down to the water!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.64,0:18:44.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She made it out of the water!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.60,0:18:45.85,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She isn't in the clear yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.85,0:18:48.19,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She hasn't broken free of the Birdcage yet.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.54,0:18:53.61,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Look at them dance, trying to secure\Nan advantageous position above!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.27,0:18:57.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's having trouble breaking free.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.60,0:19:02.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Not looking to get above me anymore?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:03.57,0:19:06.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can't touch my back like this.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.72,0:19:08.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.15,0:19:09.41,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's flying upside-down, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:09.41,0:19:14.00,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, with her back facing away,\Nshe won't be at a disadvantage in a dogfight.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.00,0:19:16.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I certainly hadn't thought of that one.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.23,0:19:21.35,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,But it should be difficult\Nto keep flying upside-down.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.35,0:19:22.74,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:22.74,0:19:24.60,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Which is why this could be the turning point.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.60,0:19:26.06,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Misaki-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.37,0:19:27.81,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not done yet!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.23,0:19:30.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Nice, Misaki!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.68,0:19:31.91,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Stay on the attack!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.91,0:19:34.40,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Easy for you to say!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:37.59,0:19:42.36,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Wow! Tobisawa's keeping up her attack\Non Inui while flying upside-down!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.90,0:19:46.79,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go on the offensive and never stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.16,0:19:50.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Saki?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.46,0:19:57.46,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.46,0:19:58.42,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.47,0:20:04.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Point to Tobisawa! 1-1!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.89,0:20:08.26,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,You're the best, Misaki-senpai!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:08.26,0:20:09.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,She's evened the score!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.39,0:20:10.70,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,That was the Cobra!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.70,0:20:14.44,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Tobisawa pulled off the Cobra\Nfrom an upside-down position to score!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.11,0:20:15.86,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Saki!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.86,0:20:17.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.67,0:20:20.32,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,There's no place for such unsightly play in our FC!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.65,0:20:22.55,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, Irina.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:23.68,0:20:29.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I'm giving this everything I've got!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.16,0:20:30.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,What about you,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:31.28,0:20:32.29,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Inui-san?!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.67,0:20:35.17,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Everything...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.51,0:20:44.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What is this feeling?{ep10 preview line}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:46.44,0:20:48.31,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She refuses to run and keeps coming at me.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.29,0:20:52.77,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My body's burning up.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.53,0:20:56.48,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to beat her.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.14,0:20:58.98,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I want to beat her in a dogfight.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:01.48,0:21:02.96,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Irina.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.52,0:21:11.62,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Point to Inui!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.79,0:21:17.08,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She ain't a shabby dogfighter either!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:17.08,0:21:18.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Ten seconds left!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.09,0:21:19.84,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is scary,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.83,0:21:21.71,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.46,0:21:28.39,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}it's so much fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.97,0:21:33.67,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,The match is over!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:37.72,0:21:40.94,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're so cool, Misaki-chan!{ep10 preview line}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:48.50,0:21:50.07,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,I couldn't beat her.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:52.83,0:21:54.16,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Misaki...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:00.36,0:22:04.72,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I've never tasted such a... {\i0}repulsive{\i1} victory before.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:46.44,0:23:47.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Fly!{ep12, 00:56}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:47.15,0:23:48.11,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Just a bit more...{ep12, 12:27}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:48.11,0:23:51.95,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Now, let us all have a moment of silence!{ep12, 08:13}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:51.95,0:23:53.23,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Let's soar to new heights...{ep12, 18:17}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:53.23,0:23:54.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,Together!{ep12, 18:19}
Comment: 0,0:23:54.15,0:23:56.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.19,0:01:38.23,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(240,240)}The birds and the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.61,0:01:41.49,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(240,240)}Pat my hair as if inviting me into the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.49,0:01:44.78,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(240,240)}And steal my attention upwards
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.62,0:01:49.50,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(240,240)}As the sunlight burns my cheeks
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.08,0:01:52.92,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(240,240)}I could look into the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.92,0:01:56.38,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(240,240)}If only I could fly like them
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.88,0:02:04.51,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(240,240)}Open your ears and listen to the starting whistle
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.51,0:02:10.43,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(240,240)}It shakes the wings of my heart as it resounds through the blue skies
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.98,0:02:16.98,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(240,240)}Let's soar past these boring, monotonous days
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.98,0:02:22.16,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(240,240)}The miracle we've been looking for is just ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.16,0:02:29.17,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(240,240)}With it, we can reach the future we've dreamed of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.70,0:02:37.92,OP,,0,0,0,,{\blur4.5\fad(240,240)}It lies just beyond our fingertips
Comment: 0,0:23:56.15,0:23:58.15,GJM_Main,,0,0,0,,ED
