Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.48,0:22:35.99,ED,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H5C85CE&\blur6\fad(240,240)}I hide away
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.99,0:22:43.00,ED,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H5C85CE&\blur6\fad(240,240)}My small sighs between the waves
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.25,0:22:47.96,ED,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFE9F52&\blur6\fad(240,240)}I could do it so well today
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.96,0:22:50.71,ED,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFE9F52&\blur6\fad(240,240)}But now I can't even catch up to them
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.17,0:22:55.18,ED,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFBC080&\blur6\fad(240,240)}You used to be so unreliable but now you've gotten so much stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.18,0:22:58.09,ED,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HFBC080&\blur6\fad(240,240)}The color of the sky changes too
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.31,0:23:04.81,ED,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H6A64A0&\blur6\fad(240,240)}T{\3c&H6A649E&}h{\3c&H6A649C&}e {\3c&H6A6498&}w{\3c&H6A6396&}i{\3c&H6A6394&}n{\3c&H696392&}d {\3c&H69638E&}k{\3c&H69638C&}n{\3c&H69638A&}o{\3c&H696388&}w{\3c&H696286&}s {\3c&H696283&}a{\3c&H696281&}l{\3c&H69627F&}l {\3c&H69627B&}t{\3c&H686279&}o{\3c&H686277&}o {\3c&H686173&}w{\3c&H686171&}e{\3c&H68616F&}l{\3c&H68616D&}l
