Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.86,0:23:15.74,ED,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HDF9B5F&\blur6\fad(240,240)}Let's take to the skies again
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.74,0:23:19.33,ED,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HB77450&\blur6\fad(240,240)}This is where everything begins
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.33,0:23:23.25,ED,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HC0632F&\blur6\fad(240,240)}It won't be the same as yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.25,0:23:26.50,ED,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HC0632F&\blur6\fad(240,240)}Look, the view from here just keeps expanding
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.50,0:23:30.05,ED,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4D1B0C&\blur6\fad(240,240)}I'll fly over to those cheeks of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.05,0:23:33.21,ED,,0,0,0,,{\3c&H4D1B0C&\blur6\fad(240,240)}That I can see nodding in the distance
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.72,0:23:40.01,ED,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HD27F4A&\blur6\fad(240,240)}Spread out these hands you've clasped together
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.85,0:23:44.48,ED,,0,0,0,,{\3c&HD27F4A&\blur6\fad(240,240)}And let's fly together
